# x on a Logbook entry removes @done so it leaves the Logbook; z puts it back with the focus on it.
file <<END
- Wrote report @done({today})
- Called bank @done({today-1})
END
keys gL
see ▌ ✔ Wrote report
keys x
hide Wrote report
see ▌ ✔ Called bank
saved <<END
- Wrote report
- Called bank @done({today-1})
END
keys z
see ▌ ✔ Wrote report
quit
saved <<END
- Wrote report @done({today})
- Called bank @done({today-1})
END
